<h1>1. A sixteen-turn live DecisionHotelGraph replay</h1>
<p>Read this first. This is a complete passing provider-backed run with <code>HOTEL_GRAPH_CURRENT_DATE</code> frozen to <code>2027-07-15</code>. It exercises a chat model (<code>gpt-4o</code>) and the Jev decision model together. Model wording can vary; normalized criteria, decision boundaries, hotel results, and completion are the durable contracts.</p>

<h2 id="run-it-yourself">Run it yourself</h2>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd ezgraph-demo
npm run test2:decision-hotel-graph</code></pre>
<p>The script sets <code>USE_ENV=1 KEEP_SESSION=1</code>. The test sends all sixteen turns through one session, semantically judges every reply, and verifies the final durable booking state. It is skipped unless <code>TYPESAFE_API_KEY</code> (for Jev decisions) and <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code> are set.</p>

